  "notes": [
    "Preregistered validation: unit-test exact hole-card swap, unchanged future board/deck order, deterministic reset, and short-deck skip; smoke must show positive and balanced mirror source/replay hands, exact total-hand/assignment accounting, finite loss, no KL stop, all-in EV counts zero, and unchanged architecture. Production only after PASS, using seed 20260852/worker seed 2026085200 and the untouched seed20260853 matched curve. Slumbot only on robust paired multi-anchor evidence.",
    "Mirrored-deal helper tests PASS 4/4: exact private-card swap, unchanged future deck order, deterministic registered reset, and missing/short-state skip.",
    "Smoke gate PASS at 4,112 actual hands: 550 source self-play deals had exactly 550 mirror replays (26.75% of environment hands combined), all-in EV evidence stayed zero, and both fixed-pool and mirror-log audits passed.",
    "Production iter9 exposed an expected update-boundary carry: 571 sources and 570 replays left one pending mirror for the next update. The worker implementation permits at most one pending mirror per worker. Corrected the still-unfrozen dedicated auditor to require cumulative source-minus-replay in [0, workers] at every boundary and terminal consistency, rather than false per-row equality; smoke re-audit PASS.",
    "Production gate PASS: 263,437 actual environment hands across 64 updates. Fixed-pool audit verified exact immutable anchors, assignment RNG/hash chain, global normalization, optimizer state, four archived checkpoints, zero KL stops, max reference KL 0.001400875, and max clip fraction 0.0000348772.",
    "Mirrored trajectory audit PASS: 35,782 source hands and 35,781 mirror replays (71,563 combined; 27.165% of actual hands). Cumulative pending stayed within [0,12] at every boundary and terminal pending=1, preserving the documented per-worker carry semantics. All-in EV remained disabled.",
    "Frozen matched curve used four archived checkpoints, the untouched seed-20260853 1,024-pair stream, all three original anchors, and raw aligned pair outcomes. Across 12 treatment-minus-control rows, 6 were positive and 6 negative; mean -0.0225, median -0.0488 bb/100, and every paired 95% interval crossed zero."
  ],
